TI  - Determination of the Insecticidal Activities of Beauveria bassiana (Ascomycota: Hypocreales) Secondary Metabolites on Dendroctonus micans (Coleoptera: Curculionidae), Glyphodes pyloalis (Lepidoptera: Pyralidae) and Thaumetopoea pityocampa (Lepidoptera: Thaumetopoeidae)
