TI  - A putative ABC transporter gene, &lt;i&gt;CcT1&lt;/i&gt;, is involved in beauvericin synthesis, conidiation, and oxidative stress resistance in &lt;i&gt;Cordyceps chanhua&lt;/i&gt;
