TI  - From omics to enhanced fungal virulence: Overexpression of a putative secreted protein improves <i>Beauveria bassiana</i> biocontrol potential against the insect pests <i>Piezodorus guildinii</i> and <i>Tenebrio molitor</i>
AU  - Oberti, Héctor
AU  - Sessa, Lucia
