TI  - "Multilocus sequence analysis for population diversity of indigenous entomopathogenic fungus <i>Beauveria bassiana</i> and its bio-efficacy against the cassava mite, <i>Tetranychus truncatus</i> Ehara (Acari: Tetranychidae)"
