TI  - RNA sequencing of Beauveria bassiana JEF-350-infected Thrips palmi reveals change of host defense and homeostasis
AU  - Jeong, Yu Jin
AU  - Kim, Jong-Cheol
AU  - Song, Gahyeon
AU  - Lee, Mi Rong
AU  - Kim, Jae Su
IS  - 1
