TI  - Alkane-priming of <i>Beauveria bassiana</i> strains to improve biocontrol of the redbanded stink bug <i>Piezodorus guildinii</i> and the bronze bug <i>Thaumastocoris peregrinus</i>
AU  - Sessa, Lucía
AU  - Pedrini, Nicolas
