TI  - DNM1, a Dynamin-Related Protein That Contributes to Endocytosis and Peroxisome Fission, Is Required for the Vegetative Growth, Sporulation, and Virulence of Metarhizium <i>robertsii</i>
AU  - Xie, Xiangyun
