TI  - AoMedA has a complex regulatory relationship with AoBrlA, AoAbaA, and AoWetA in conidiation, trap formation, and secondary metabolism in the nematode-trapping fungus <i>Arthrobotrys oligospora</i>
AU  - Bai, Na
