TI  - An obligate microsporidian parasite modulates defense against opportunistic bacterial infection in the yellow fever mosquito&lt;i&gt;, Aedes aegypti&lt;/i&gt;
AU  - El-Dougdoug, Noha K
AU  - El-Dougdoug, Noha K
AU  - Magistrado, Dom
