AB  - Different biological, ecological characteristics and cultural traits, including texture, color and growth rate of colony, sporulation, half germination time (GT_(50)), hydration viability, UV radiation viability and bathing viability of 22 strains of Beauveria bassiana were determined. Based on coded cultural traits, the correlation coefficient matrix of strains was calculated. The average coefficient (S) of each strain was processed and the strains Bb4, Bb13, Bb23, Bb36, Bb38, Bb48, Bb59, Bb77, Bb81, Bb86 and Bb88 were classified as type strain alternatives by S>75%. Among them, the strain Bb4 was determined as the central strain with highest coefficient value.
